OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FThe chair of the Independent Football
OL,8,FRegulator (IFR) has said he will quit
OL,9,Fif there is political interference in
OL,10,Fany future investigation launched into
OL,11,FManchester City.
OL,13,FThe club have been found guilty by an
OL,14,Findependent commission of clearly
OL,15,Fintending to circumvent Premier League
OL,16,Ffinancial rules over a nine-season
OL,17,Fperiod.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
