PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FCity have appealed against the
OL,8,Fverdict, but if it is upheld the IFR
OL,9,Fcould also act, and has the power to
OL,10,Fforce owners to divest from clubs in
OL,11,Fextreme cases.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham raised
OL,14,Feyebrows when he said he would be
OL,15,F"really concerned" if City's Abu Dhabi
OL,16,Fowners left following the commission
OL,17,Fverdict, emphasising the potential for
OL,18,Fthis case to have implications for
OL,19,Fdiplomatic and trade relations between
OL,20,Fthe United Kingdom and the United Arab
OL,21,FEmirates.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
