OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FIFR chair David Kogan was adamant
OL,13,Fhowever that he and his body would not
OL,14,Fstand for any meddling in their work,
OL,15,Fshould they seek to take action
OL,16,Fagainst City's owners in the future.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,F"We are absolutely bound by one thing,
OL,8,Fand that one thing is regulating
OL,9,Ffootball and regulating football
OL,10,Fclubs," he said at the launch of the
OL,11,FIFR's 'State of the Game' report in
OL,12,FManchester on Tuesday.
OL,14,F"Our independence is absolute, and my
OL,15,Findependence personally is absolute. I
OL,16,Fmade it very clear in an interview
OL,17,Flast year that if we (experience) any
OL,18,Fform of political interference on the
OL,19,Fway we operate it is going to result
OL,20,Fin my resigning from this role, and I
OL,21,Fstand by that completely.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@GO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,F"Just to be crystal clear, we've come
OL,8,Funder absolutely no political pressure
OL,9,Fwhatsoever on this or any other topic,
OL,10,Fand I don't expect to in the future."
OL,12,FAn earlier draft of the Football
OL,13,FGovernance Bill contained a clause
OL,14,Fwhich said the IFR needed to "have
OL,15,Fregard to the foreign and trade policy
OL,16,Fobjectives" of the UK Government in
OL,17,Fmaking suitability assessments, but
OL,18,Fthis was scrapped.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@eO]vD@^OUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
