OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FKogan's hiring as IFR chair was the
OL,8,Fsubject of an inquiry by the
OL,9,FCommissioner for Public Appointments
OL,10,Fover his historic links to the Labour
OL,11,FParty.
OL,13,FWhile it found rules had been broken
OL,14,Fby Culture Secretary Lisa Nandy for
OL,15,Ffailing to declare donations she had
OL,16,Freceived from Kogan, the inquiry
OL,17,Faccepted he was not aware of the
OL,18,Fdeviation from best practice and made
OL,19,Fno finding about his suitability for
OL,20,Fthe role.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
