CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FShadow Culture Minister Louie French
OL,8,Fhas since said of Kogan that a "Labour
OL,9,Fdonor and key crony cannot lead an
OL,10,FIndependent Football Regulator".
OL,12,FKogan said: "I've been doing the job
OL,13,Fproperly, and the idea that you would
OL,14,Fassociate that (his history of
OL,15,Fdonations to the Labour Party) with
OL,16,Fanything to do with the politics of
OL,17,Fwhat's going on at the moment around
OL,18,FManchester City is just frankly
OL,19,Fludicrous.
OL,26,@pD@`OUrD@_O]tD@MOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
