OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,F"I'm not in the slightest bit
OL,8,Fconcerned about accusations about my
OL,9,Fprobity. I think it stands up to
OL,10,Fscrutiny, and you're more than welcome
OL,11,Fto scrutinise it."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@RO]
