OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FThe 'State of the Game' report
OL,8,Fhighlighted how the Premier League's
OL,9,Fadministrative costs in fighting legal
OL,10,Fcases had soared from #45million in
OL,11,F2015-16 to #212m in 2024-25, covering
OL,12,Fmost of the period where the league
OL,13,Fwas fighting its main legal case
OL,14,Fagainst City and separate ones against
OL,15,Fthe club related to the league's
OL,16,Fassociated party transaction (APT)
OL,17,Frules.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
