PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FKogan said the bill for any future IFR
OL,8,Flegal case against City would
OL,9,Fultimately be paid by the clubs
OL,10,Fthemselves.
OL,12,F"We wouldn't go into legal action
OL,13,Funless we thought we were going to
OL,14,Fwin," he added.
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@EO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
