OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1791987504
OL,3,CFootball regulator vows to quit if
OL,4,Cthere is interference into Man City
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,F"Whereas the Government will be cash-
OL,8,Fflowing us to do stuff ` and they
OL,9,Fabsolutely have to do that because
OL,10,Fwe're not going to go into legal
OL,11,Faction unless we know we can afford to
OL,12,Fpay for it ` then ultimately, that
OL,13,Fwill be charged back to football as
OL,14,Fpart of the levy mechanism.
OL,16,F"I don't expect a problem with the
OL,17,FTreasury or with DCMS if we're
OL,18,Fsuddenly facing a substantive legal
OL,19,Fchallenge, assuming we believe that
OL,20,Flegal challenge is one that we're
OL,21,Fprepared to fight and prepared to win."
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU}D@gO]
